# The robot pit (`game::robot`) in level 1, for `scripts/record-run --capture` (format:
# src/capture/timeline.rs). Start a few tiles before the pit, Sparky's antenna blinking in it:
#   NATHAN_START=84 scripts/record-run --capture robot-pit.mp4 scripts/tours/robot-pit.timeline 1
# Run into the pit: WRONG GAME! Stroll the meadow while Sparky chats, pick a wrong pad (his
# battery drains), then the right one (5), and round the pond into the whirlpool: back on the
# ledge, "Where were you?!". ~30 s. (Nat walks a tile in 1/6 s there: 167ms a tile.)

# The level's intro line; a look at the antenna.
wait 2.5

# Off the ledge.
hold Right 0.9

# Falling, then WRONG GAME!
wait 2.4

# Sparky chats (three lines): a stroll round the path while he does.
hold Left 500ms
hold Up 333ms
hold Right 1000ms
hold Down 333ms
hold Left 500ms
wait 4.7

# The question: NAT has 3 nuggets, HAN finds 2 more. Not 4...
hold Down 333ms
wait 2.6

# ...it's 5.
hold Up 167ms
hold Right 500ms
hold Down 167ms
wait 3.6

# Home: round the pond to the whirlpool's open side.
hold Down 167ms
hold Right 1833ms
hold Up 333ms
hold Left 333ms

# Down the drain, and back: Han wants to know.
wait 4.5
